      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<!-- ============================================================\n     A-DIY — High-Converting Landing Page\n     Shopify \"page\" template ready — paste into page.liquid or\n     Custom HTML block. Self-contained CSS + JS, no dependencies.\n     ============================================================ -->\n\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Barlow+Condensed:wght@700;800;900&family=Barlow:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;1,400&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n<style>\n/* ── RESET & BASE ── */\n.adiy-page *, .adiy-page *::before, .adiy-page *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n.adiy-page { font-family: 'Barlow', sans-serif; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; color: #1a1a18; background: #fff; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }\n\n/* ── TOKENS ── */\n.adiy-page {\n  --yellow: #F5A623;\n  --yellow-dark: #D4881A;\n  --yellow-light: #FEF5E4;\n  --green: #2A6E47;\n  --green-light: #EAF5EF;\n  --dark: #1a1a18;\n  --mid: #4a4a46;\n  --muted: #7a7a74;\n  --border: #e5e5e0;\n  --bg-off: #F8F7F3;\n  --bg-dark: #18180F;\n  --red-light: #FEF0EF;\n  --red: #C0392B;\n  --radius: 10px;\n  --radius-lg: 16px;\n  --shadow: 0 2px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\n  --shadow-lg: 0 8px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.13);\n}\n\n/* ── LAYOUT ── */\n.adiy-container { max-width: 1080px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; }\n.adiy-container--narrow { max-width: 780px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; }\n\n/* ── TYPOGRAPHY ── */\n.adiy-eyebrow {\n  display: inline-block;\n  font-family: 'Barlow', sans-serif;\n  font-size: 12px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.12em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--yellow-dark);\n  margin-bottom: 12px;\n}\n.adiy-h1 {\n  font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;\n  font-size: clamp(40px, 7vw, 72px);\n  font-weight: 900;\n  line-height: 1.0;\n  letter-spacing: -0.01em;\n  color: #fff;\n}\n.adiy-h2 {\n  font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;\n  font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 52px);\n  font-weight: 800;\n  line-height: 1.05;\n  color: var(--dark);\n}\n.adiy-h3 {\n  font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;\n  font-size: clamp(22px, 3.5vw, 32px);\n  font-weight: 700;\n  line-height: 1.1;\n  color: var(--dark);\n}\n.adiy-lead { font-size: clamp(16px, 2vw, 20px); line-height: 1.6; color: var(--mid); }\n\n/* ── BUTTONS ── */\n.adiy-btn {\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n  font-family: 'Barlow', sans-serif;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  font-size: 15px;\n  letter-spacing: 0.01em;\n  padding: 14px 28px;\n  border-radius: 6px;\n  border: 2px solid transparent;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  text-decoration: none;\n  transition: transform 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease, background 0.15s ease;\n  white-space: nowrap;\n}\n.adiy-btn:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); }\n.adiy-btn:active { transform: translateY(0); }\n\n.adiy-btn--primary {\n  background: var(--yellow);\n  color: #1a1200;\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(245,166,35,0.35);\n}\n.adiy-btn--primary:hover { background: var(--yellow-dark); box-shadow: 0 6px 28px rgba(245,166,35,0.45); }\n\n.adiy-btn--secondary {\n  background: transparent;\n  color: #fff;\n  border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);\n}\n.adiy-btn--secondary:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border-color: #fff; }\n\n.adiy-btn--secondary-dark {\n  background: transparent;\n  color: var(--dark);\n  border-color: var(--border);\n}\n.adiy-btn--secondary-dark:hover { border-color: var(--dark); background: var(--bg-off); }\n\n.adiy-btn--lg { padding: 17px 36px; font-size: 17px; }\n.adiy-btn--block { width: 100%; justify-content: center; }\n\n.adiy-cta-group { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; align-items: center; }\n\n/* ── SECTIONS ── */\n.adiy-section { padding: 80px 0; }\n.adiy-section--sm { padding: 56px 0; }\n.adiy-section--dark { background: var(--bg-dark); }\n.adiy-section--off { background: var(--bg-off); }\n.adiy-section--yellow { background: var(--yellow); }\n\n/* ── TRUST BAR ── */\n.adiy-trustbar {\n  background: var(--bg-dark);\n  padding: 10px 24px;\n  text-align: center;\n  font-size: 13px;\n  font-weight: 500;\n  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75);\n  letter-spacing: 0.03em;\n}\n.adiy-trustbar span { color: var(--yellow); }\n\n/* ── HERO ── */\n.adiy-hero {\n  background: var(--bg-dark);\n  padding: 80px 0 72px;\n  position: relative;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n.adiy-hero::before {\n  content: '';\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0;\n  background:\n    radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 50% at 80% 50%, rgba(245,166,35,0.12) 0%, transparent 70%),\n    radial-gradient(ellipse 40% 60% at 10% 80%, rgba(42,110,71,0.1) 0%, transparent 70%);\n  pointer-events: none;\n}\n/* Wood grain texture overlay */\n.adiy-hero::after {\n  content: '';\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0;\n  background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(\n    87deg,\n    transparent 0px,\n    transparent 18px,\n    rgba(255,255,255,0.015) 18px,\n    rgba(255,255,255,0.015) 19px\n  );\n  pointer-events: none;\n}\n.adiy-hero__inner { position: relative; z-index: 1; }\n.adiy-hero__stars { color: var(--yellow); font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 6px; letter-spacing: 2px; }\n.adiy-hero__trust { font-size: 13px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6); margin-bottom: 28px; }\n.adiy-hero__trust strong { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9); }\n.adiy-hero__sub {\n  font-size: clamp(16px, 2.2vw, 20px);\n  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75);\n  max-width: 600px;\n  margin: 18px 0 32px;\n  line-height: 1.55;\n}\n.adiy-hero__sub strong { color: #fff; }\n.adiy-hero__microcopy { margin-top: 16px; font-size: 13px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.45); }\n\n/* ── STAT BAND ── */\n.adiy-statband {\n  background: var(--yellow);\n  padding: 32px 0;\n}\n.adiy-statband__grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr));\n  gap: 0;\n}\n.adiy-stat {\n  text-align: center;\n  padding: 16px 24px;\n  border-right: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.12);\n}\n.adiy-stat:last-child { border-right: none; }\n.adiy-stat__num {\n  font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;\n  font-size: 42px;\n  font-weight: 900;\n  color: #1a1200;\n  line-height: 1;\n}\n.adiy-stat__label { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: rgba(26,18,0,0.65); margin-top: 4px; }\n\n/* ── PROBLEM ── */\n.adiy-problem__grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n  gap: 24px;\n  margin-top: 48px;\n}\n.adiy-problem__card {\n  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n  padding: 32px;\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\n}\n.adiy-problem__card--contractor { background: var(--red-light); border-color: #f5c0bc; }\n.adiy-problem__card--diy { background: #FFF8EC; border-color: #f5dfa0; }\n\n.adiy-problem__icon { font-size: 32px; margin-bottom: 12px; }\n.adiy-problem__title {\n  font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;\n  font-size: 24px;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  margin-bottom: 8px;\n}\n.adiy-problem__subtitle { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 20px; font-style: italic; }\n\n.adiy-pain-item {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 12px;\n  margin-bottom: 16px;\n  align-items: flex-start;\n}\n.adiy-pain-item__icon {\n  width: 22px;\n  height: 22px;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  font-size: 11px;\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n  margin-top: 2px;\n}\n.adiy-pain-item__title { font-weight: 600; font-size: 15px; color: var(--dark); }\n.adiy-pain-item__body { font-size: 14px; color: var(--mid); margin-top: 2px; line-height: 1.5; }\n\n.adiy-pullquote {\n  background: var(--bg-off);\n  border-left: 4px solid var(--yellow);\n  border-radius: 0 var(--radius) var(--radius) 0;\n  padding: 20px 24px;\n  margin-top: 48px;\n  font-size: 18px;\n  font-style: italic;\n  color: var(--dark);\n  line-height: 1.55;\n}\n.adiy-pullquote cite { display: block; font-style: normal; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 10px; }\n\n/* ── SOLUTION ── */\n.adiy-solution__intro { max-width: 640px; margin-bottom: 48px; }\n\n.adiy-comparison {\n  width: 100%;\n  border-collapse: collapse;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n  overflow: hidden;\n  box-shadow: var(--shadow);\n  font-size: 14px;\n}\n.adiy-comparison thead tr { background: var(--dark); color: #fff; }\n.adiy-comparison thead th {\n  padding: 14px 18px;\n  text-align: left;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  font-size: 13px;\n  letter-spacing: 0.04em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n.adiy-comparison thead th.adiy-col--winner {\n  background: var(--yellow);\n  color: #1a1200;\n}\n.adiy-comparison tbody tr { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }\n.adiy-comparison tbody tr:last-child { border-bottom: none; }\n.adiy-comparison tbody tr:nth-child(even) { background: var(--bg-off); }\n.adiy-comparison tbody tr:nth-child(even) td.adiy-col--winner { background: #FEF5E4; }\n.adiy-comparison tbody td { padding: 13px 18px; color: var(--mid); vertical-align: top; }\n.adiy-comparison tbody td:first-child { font-weight: 600; color: var(--dark); }\n.adiy-comparison tbody td.adiy-col--winner { color: var(--green); font-weight: 600; background: #f6fbf8; }\n.adiy-comparison tbody td.adiy-col--bad { color: #b03a2e; }\n\n/* ── HOW IT WORKS ── */\n.adiy-steps { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0; margin-top: 48px; position: relative; }\n.adiy-steps::before {\n  content: '';\n  position: absolute;\n  left: 27px;\n  top: 28px;\n  bottom: 28px;\n  width: 2px;\n  background: linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--yellow), var(--green));\n}\n.adiy-step {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 24px;\n  align-items: flex-start;\n  padding: 0 0 40px;\n  position: relative;\n}\n.adiy-step:last-child { padding-bottom: 0; }\n.adiy-step__num {\n  width: 56px;\n  height: 56px;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  background: var(--yellow);\n  color: #1a1200;\n  font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;\n  font-weight: 900;\n  font-size: 22px;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n  position: relative;\n  z-index: 1;\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px #fff, 0 0 0 6px rgba(245,166,35,0.2);\n}\n.adiy-step__content { padding-top: 10px; }\n.adiy-step__title { font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--dark); margin-bottom: 6px; }\n.adiy-step__body { font-size: 15px; color: var(--mid); line-height: 1.6; }\n\n/* ── BENEFITS ── */\n.adiy-benefits__grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));\n  gap: 20px;\n  margin-top: 48px;\n}\n.adiy-benefit {\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n  padding: 24px;\n  transition: box-shadow 0.2s, transform 0.2s;\n}\n.adiy-benefit:hover { box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg); transform: translateY(-3px); }\n.adiy-benefit__icon { font-size: 28px; margin-bottom: 12px; }\n.adiy-benefit__title { font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px; color: var(--dark); margin-bottom: 6px; }\n.adiy-benefit__body { font-size: 14px; color: var(--mid); line-height: 1.55; }\n\n/* ── SOCIAL PROOF ── */\n.adiy-reviews__grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));\n  gap: 20px;\n  margin-top: 48px;\n}\n.adiy-review {\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n  padding: 28px;\n  position: relative;\n}\n.adiy-review::before {\n  content: '\\201C';\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 16px;\n  right: 22px;\n  font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;\n  font-size: 80px;\n  font-weight: 900;\n  color: var(--yellow);\n  line-height: 1;\n  opacity: 0.25;\n}\n.adiy-review__stars { color: var(--yellow); font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 2px; margin-bottom: 12px; }\n.adiy-review__tag {\n  display: inline-block;\n  font-size: 11px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 0.06em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  background: var(--yellow-light);\n  color: var(--yellow-dark);\n  border-radius: 4px;\n  padding: 3px 8px;\n  margin-bottom: 12px;\n}\n.adiy-review__text { font-size: 15px; color: var(--mid); line-height: 1.65; font-style: italic; }\n.adiy-review__author { margin-top: 16px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--dark); }\n.adiy-review__location { font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); }\n\n.adiy-trust-badges {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  gap: 16px;\n  justify-content: center;\n  margin-top: 48px;\n  padding-top: 40px;\n  border-top: 1px solid var(--border);\n}\n.adiy-trust-badge {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n  background: var(--bg-off);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\n  border-radius: 40px;\n  padding: 10px 20px;\n  font-size: 14px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: var(--dark);\n}\n.adiy-trust-badge span { font-size: 18px; }\n\n/* ── DECISION SPLIT ── */\n.adiy-split {\n  background: var(--bg-dark);\n  padding: 80px 0;\n}\n.adiy-split__header { text-align: center; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 48px; }\n.adiy-split__header .adiy-h2 { color: #fff; }\n.adiy-split__header p { font-size: 18px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.65); margin-top: 12px; }\n\n.adiy-split__grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n  gap: 24px;\n}\n.adiy-split__card {\n  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n  padding: 36px 32px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n}\n.adiy-split__card--consult {\n  background: var(--yellow);\n  color: #1a1200;\n}\n.adiy-split__card--shop {\n  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.07);\n  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);\n  color: #fff;\n}\n.adiy-split__card__eyebrow {\n  font-size: 12px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 0.1em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  opacity: 0.6;\n  margin-bottom: 12px;\n}\n.adiy-split__card__title {\n  font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;\n  font-size: clamp(22px, 3vw, 30px);\n  font-weight: 800;\n  line-height: 1.1;\n  margin-bottom: 14px;\n}\n.adiy-split__card__body { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; opacity: 0.8; margin-bottom: 28px; flex: 1; }\n.adiy-split__card--consult .adiy-btn--split-p {\n  background: #1a1200;\n  color: var(--yellow);\n  border: none;\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n  font-family: 'Barlow', sans-serif;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  font-size: 15px;\n  padding: 14px 24px;\n  border-radius: 6px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  text-decoration: none;\n  transition: transform 0.15s, background 0.15s;\n}\n.adiy-split__card--consult .adiy-btn--split-p:hover { background: #2d2200; transform: translateY(-2px); }\n.adiy-split__card--shop .adiy-btn--split-s {\n  background: var(--yellow);\n  color: #1a1200;\n  border: none;\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n  font-family: 'Barlow', sans-serif;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  font-size: 15px;\n  padding: 14px 24px;\n  border-radius: 6px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  text-decoration: none;\n  transition: transform 0.15s, background 0.15s;\n}\n.adiy-split__card--shop .adiy-btn--split-s:hover { background: var(--yellow-dark); transform: translateY(-2px); }\n.adiy-split__card__microcopy { font-size: 12px; margin-top: 12px; opacity: 0.5; }\n\n/* ── FAQ ── */\n.adiy-faq__list { margin-top: 48px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); overflow: hidden; }\n.adiy-faq__item { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }\n.adiy-faq__item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }\n.adiy-faq__q {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: center;\n  padding: 20px 24px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  background: #fff;\n  transition: background 0.15s;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  color: var(--dark);\n  gap: 16px;\n  list-style: none;\n  user-select: none;\n}\n.adiy-faq__q:hover { background: var(--bg-off); }\n.adiy-faq__q::after {\n  content: '+';\n  font-size: 22px;\n  font-weight: 400;\n  color: var(--yellow-dark);\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n  transition: transform 0.2s;\n}\n.adiy-faq__item.open .adiy-faq__q { background: var(--bg-off); }\n.adiy-faq__item.open .adiy-faq__q::after { content: '−'; }\n.adiy-faq__a {\n  display: none;\n  padding: 0 24px 20px;\n  font-size: 15px;\n  color: var(--mid);\n  line-height: 1.7;\n  background: var(--bg-off);\n}\n.adiy-faq__item.open .adiy-faq__a { display: block; }\n\n/* ── FINAL CTA ── */\n.adiy-close {\n  background: var(--bg-dark);\n  padding: 96px 0;\n  text-align: center;\n  position: relative;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n.adiy-close::before {\n  content: '';\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0;\n  background:\n    radial-gradient(ellipse 50% 60% at 50% 100%, rgba(245,166,35,0.15) 0%, transparent 70%);\n  pointer-events: none;\n}\n.adiy-close__inner { position: relative; z-index: 1; }\n.adiy-close .adiy-h2 { color: #fff; max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto 20px; }\n.adiy-close__body { font-size: 18px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.65); max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto 36px; line-height: 1.65; }\n.adiy-close__ctas { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 14px; justify-content: center; }\n.adiy-close__trust { margin-top: 28px; font-size: 13px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4); }\n.adiy-close__trust .adiy-close__stars { color: var(--yellow); }\n\n/* ── DIVIDER ── */\n.adiy-divider { border: none; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); margin: 0; }\n\n/* ── ANIMATIONS ── */\n@keyframes adiy-fadein {\n  from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(18px); }\n  to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }\n}\n.adiy-anim { opacity: 0; }\n.adiy-anim.visible { animation: adiy-fadein 0.55s ease forwards; }\n.adiy-anim-d1 { animation-delay: 0.05s; }\n.adiy-anim-d2 { animation-delay: 0.15s; }\n.adiy-anim-d3 { animation-delay: 0.25s; }\n.adiy-anim-d4 { animation-delay: 0.35s; }\n\n/* ── RESPONSIVE ── */\n@media (max-width: 720px) {\n  .adiy-problem__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n  .adiy-split__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n  .adiy-statband__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }\n  .adiy-stat { border-right: none; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.12); }\n  .adiy-stat:nth-child(odd) { border-right: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.12); }\n  .adiy-stat:last-child, .adiy-stat:nth-last-child(2):nth-child(odd) { border-bottom: none; }\n  .adiy-comparison { font-size: 13px; }\n  .adiy-comparison thead th, .adiy-comparison tbody td { padding: 10px 12px; }\n  .adiy-section { padding: 56px 0; }\n  .adiy-hero { padding: 56px 0 48px; }\n  .adiy-close { padding: 64px 0; }\n  .adiy-split { padding: 56px 0; }\n  .adiy-btn--lg { padding: 14px 24px; font-size: 15px; }\n  .adiy-steps::before { left: 23px; }\n  .adiy-step__num { width: 48px; height: 48px; font-size: 18px; }\n}\n@media (max-width: 480px) {\n  .adiy-statband__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }\n  .adiy-cta-group { flex-direction: column; }\n  .adiy-cta-group .adiy-btn { width: 100%; justify-content: center; }\n  .adiy-close__ctas { flex-direction: column; align-items: center; }\n  .adiy-close__ctas .adiy-btn { width: 100%; max-width: 360px; justify-content: center; }\n}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"adiy-page\">\n\n  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════\n       TRUST BAR\n  ══════════════════════════════════ -->\n  <div class=\"adiy-trustbar\">\n    <span>★★★★★</span> Over 5,000 homeowners have built their dream deck — without a contractor\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════\n       SECTION 1 — HERO\n  ══════════════════════════════════ -->\n  <section class=\"adiy-hero\">\n    <div class=\"adiy-container\">\n      <div class=\"adiy-hero__inner\">\n        <div class=\"adiy-anim adiy-anim-d1\">\n          <div class=\"adiy-hero__stars\">★★★★★</div>\n          <div class=\"adiy-hero__trust\">Rated <strong>4.9/5</strong> by verified buyers &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Ships to your door</strong> &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Expert support included</strong></div>\n        </div>\n        <h1 class=\"adiy-h1 adiy-anim adiy-anim-d2\">\n          Your Dream Deck<br>Is One Weekend Away.\n        </h1>\n        <p class=\"adiy-hero__sub adiy-anim adiy-anim-d3\">\n          <strong>No contractor. No confusion. No regret.</strong> A-DIY deck kits arrive pre-cut, pre-measured, and ready to assemble — saving you 30–50% versus hiring out, with results you'll be proud of for decades.\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"adiy-cta-group adiy-anim adiy-anim-d4\">\n          <a href=\"https://a-diy.com/pages/design-consultation-1\" class=\"adiy-btn adiy-btn--primary adiy-btn--lg\">\n            👋 Book a Free Design Consultation\n          </a>\n          <a href=\"https://a-diy.com/products/pressure-treated-kiln-dried-wood-deck-kit\" class=\"adiy-btn adiy-btn--secondary adiy-btn--lg\">\n            🛒 Shop Deck Kits\n          </a>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"adiy-hero__microcopy\">Free consultation · 15 minutes · No pressure, just answers</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════\n       STAT BAND\n  ══════════════════════════════════ -->\n  <div class=\"adiy-statband\">\n    <div class=\"adiy-container\">\n      <div class=\"adiy-statband__grid\">\n        <div class=\"adiy-stat\">\n          <div class=\"adiy-stat__num\">5,000+</div>\n          <div class=\"adiy-stat__label\">Decks Built by Homeowners</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"adiy-stat\">\n          <div class=\"adiy-stat__num\">30–50%</div>\n          <div class=\"adiy-stat__label\">Savings vs. Contractors</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"adiy-stat\">\n          <div class=\"adiy-stat__num\">1 Day</div>\n          <div class=\"adiy-stat__label\">Average Assembly Time</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"adiy-stat\">\n          <div class=\"adiy-stat__num\">4.9★</div>\n          <div class=\"adiy-stat__label\">Average Customer Rating</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════\n       SECTION 2 — PROBLEM / AGITATION\n  ══════════════════════════════════ -->\n  <section class=\"adiy-section\" style=\"background:#fff;\">\n    <div class=\"adiy-container\">\n      <div class=\"adiy-anim\">\n        <span class=\"adiy-eyebrow\">Sound familiar?</span>\n        <h2 class=\"adiy-h2\" style=\"max-width:640px;\">The Two Options Most Homeowners Consider — And Why Both Feel Impossible</h2>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"adiy-problem__grid adiy-anim\">\n        <!-- Contractor -->\n        <div class=\"adiy-problem__card adiy-problem__card--contractor\">\n          <div class=\"adiy-problem__icon\">👷</div>\n          <div class=\"adiy-problem__title\">Hiring a Contractor</div>\n          <div class=\"adiy-problem__subtitle\">\"Show up Monday, deck is done Friday.\" — The reality is very different.</div>\n          <div class=\"adiy-pain-item\">\n            <div class=\"adiy-pain-item__icon\">✗</div>\n            <div>\n              <div class=\"adiy-pain-item__title\">Quotes that shock you</div>\n              <div class=\"adiy-pain-item__body\">Most homeowners get estimates 2–3× higher than expected. Labor alone often costs more than the entire kit.</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"adiy-pain-item\">\n            <div class=\"adiy-pain-item__icon\">✗</div>\n            <div>\n              <div class=\"adiy-pain-item__title\">The endless waiting game</div>\n              <div class=\"adiy-pain-item__body\">Between scheduling, delays, and weather, \"2 weeks\" routinely becomes 2 months.</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"adiy-pain-item\">\n            <div class=\"adiy-pain-item__icon\">✗</div>\n            <div>\n              <div class=\"adiy-pain-item__title\">Zero control over your own backyard</div>\n              <div class=\"adiy-pain-item__body\">You hand over your budget and your outdoor space — and hope for the best.</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <!-- Traditional DIY -->\n        <div class=\"adiy-problem__card adiy-problem__card--diy\">\n          <div class=\"adiy-problem__icon\">🔨</div>\n          <div class=\"adiy-problem__title\">Traditional DIY</div>\n          <div class=\"adiy-problem__subtitle\">\"Save money, feel proud, done in a weekend.\" — Also not how it goes.</div>\n          <div class=\"adiy-pain-item\">\n            <div class=\"adiy-pain-item__icon\">✗</div>\n            <div>\n              <div class=\"adiy-pain-item__title\">Where do you even start?</div>\n              <div class=\"adiy-pain-item__body\">Lumber calculations, structural planning, material lists — it's a part-time job before a single board is cut.</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"adiy-pain-item\">\n            <div class=\"adiy-pain-item__icon\">✗</div>\n            <div>\n              <div class=\"adiy-pain-item__title\">Tool overload and hidden costs</div>\n              <div class=\"adiy-pain-item__body\">Circular saw, miter saw, level, post-hole digger — rental fees and mistakes add up fast.</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"adiy-pain-item\">\n            <div class=\"adiy-pain-item__icon\">✗</div>\n            <div>\n              <div class=\"adiy-pain-item__title\">Weekends that disappear</div>\n              <div class=\"adiy-pain-item__body\">Traditional DIY decks often stretch over months. Family weekends become work weekends — indefinitely.</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <!-- Pull quote -->\n      <div class=\"adiy-pullquote adiy-anim\">\n        \"I got three contractor quotes. The lowest was $18,000. My A-DIY deck cost a fraction of that — and I built it myself in one day.\"\n        <cite>— Lori M., Verified Buyer</cite>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════\n       SECTION 3 — SOLUTION\n  ══════════════════════════════════ -->\n  <section class=\"adiy-section adiy-section--off\">\n    <div class=\"adiy-container\">\n      <div class=\"adiy-anim\">\n        <span class=\"adiy-eyebrow\">There's a third way</span>\n        <h2 class=\"adiy-h2\" style=\"max-width:640px;\">Professional-Grade Decks You Build Yourself — in Hours, Not Weeks</h2>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"adiy-solution__intro adiy-anim\" style=\"margin-top:20px;\">\n        <p class=\"adiy-lead\">A-DIY deck kits were designed for homeowners — not contractors. Every board arrives <strong>pre-cut to size</strong>, every piece is <strong>pre-measured and labeled</strong>, and the 3D visual instructions are foolproof. The only tool you need is a power drill you probably already own.</p>\n        <p style=\"margin-top:16px; color:var(--mid); font-size:15px;\">It's not traditional DIY. It's not hiring out. It's the option that delivers a <strong>beautiful, lasting deck</strong> at a fraction of the cost — with the satisfaction of knowing you built it yourself.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Comparison table -->\n      <div class=\"adiy-anim\" style=\"margin-top:40px; overflow-x:auto;\">\n        <table class=\"adiy-comparison\">\n          <thead>\n            <tr>\n              <th>Category</th>\n              <th class=\"adiy-col--bad\">Contractor</th>\n              <th class=\"adiy-col--bad\">Traditional DIY</th>\n              <th class=\"adiy-col--winner\">✓ A-DIY Kit</th>\n            </tr>\n          </thead>\n          <tbody>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Cost</td>\n              <td class=\"adiy-col--bad\">$15,000–$30,000+</td>\n              <td class=\"adiy-col--bad\">Varies — hidden costs add up</td>\n              <td class=\"adiy-col--winner\">30–50% less than contractor</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Time to Build</td>\n              <td class=\"adiy-col--bad\">2–8 weeks (with delays)</td>\n              <td class=\"adiy-col--bad\">Months of weekends</td>\n              <td class=\"adiy-col--winner\">Done in a day</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Tools Required</td>\n              <td>Contractor brings theirs</td>\n              <td class=\"adiy-col--bad\">Saws, levels, more</td>\n              <td class=\"adiy-col--winner\">Just a power drill</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Skill Level</td>\n              <td>None (but costly)</td>\n              <td class=\"adiy-col--bad\">Intermediate–advanced</td>\n              <td class=\"adiy-col--winner\">Complete beginner</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Stress Level</td>\n              <td class=\"adiy-col--bad\">High — scheduling, invoices</td>\n              <td class=\"adiy-col--bad\">High — mistakes, re-dos</td>\n              <td class=\"adiy-col--winner\">Low — everything included</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>End Result</td>\n              <td>Professional finish</td>\n              <td class=\"adiy-col--bad\">Depends on skill</td>\n              <td class=\"adiy-col--winner\">Professional finish</td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"adiy-anim\" style=\"margin-top:36px;\">\n        <a href=\"https://a-diy.com/pages/design-consultation-1\" class=\"adiy-btn adiy-btn--primary adiy-btn--lg\">👋 Book a Free Design Consultation</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════\n       SECTION 4 — HOW IT WORKS\n  ══════════════════════════════════ -->\n  <section class=\"adiy-section\" style=\"background:#fff;\">\n    <div class=\"adiy-container--narrow\">\n      <div class=\"adiy-anim\">\n        <span class=\"adiy-eyebrow\">Step by step</span>\n        <h2 class=\"adiy-h2\">Here's Exactly How It Works</h2>\n        <p class=\"adiy-lead\" style=\"margin-top:12px; max-width:520px;\">No experience needed. No contractor required. Just follow the steps — and enjoy your new deck this weekend.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"adiy-steps adiy-anim\">\n        <div class=\"adiy-step\">\n          <div class=\"adiy-step__num\">1</div>\n          <div class=\"adiy-step__content\">\n            <div class=\"adiy-step__title\">Design Your Deck</div>\n            <div class=\"adiy-step__body\">Tell us your space and style. Book a free 15-minute design consultation or browse standard kit sizes online. We'll find the right fit for your yard, budget, and vision — no guesswork required.</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"adiy-step\">\n          <div class=\"adiy-step__num\">2</div>\n          <div class=\"adiy-step__content\">\n            <div class=\"adiy-step__title\">Your Kit Ships to Your Door</div>\n            <div class=\"adiy-step__body\">Every board is pre-cut, pre-measured, and labeled. Hardware, screws, and a drill bit are included. Nothing is missing — you won't make a single trip to the lumber yard or hardware store.</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"adiy-step\">\n          <div class=\"adiy-step__num\">3</div>\n          <div class=\"adiy-step__content\">\n            <div class=\"adiy-step__title\">Set Your Foundation</div>\n            <div class=\"adiy-step__body\">Choose your base: deck blocks (no digging required), sono tubes, or helical piles for elevated builds. We walk you through which option fits your yard's grade and your deck's height.</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"adiy-step\">\n          <div class=\"adiy-step__num\">4</div>\n          <div class=\"adiy-step__content\">\n            <div class=\"adiy-step__title\">Assemble Like LEGO</div>\n            <div class=\"adiy-step__body\">Follow the 3D visual instructions — no blueprints, no guesswork, no second-guessing. Boards connect systematically. Most customers complete their full deck in a single day.</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"adiy-step\">\n          <div class=\"adiy-step__num\">5</div>\n          <div class=\"adiy-step__content\">\n            <div class=\"adiy-step__title\">Enjoy Your Backyard</div>\n            <div class=\"adiy-step__body\">Add optional railings, stairs, or a pergola. Then pour a drink and sit down on something you built yourself. That feeling? It's worth every minute.</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════\n       SECTION 5 — BENEFITS\n  ══════════════════════════════════ -->\n  <section class=\"adiy-section adiy-section--off\">\n    <div class=\"adiy-container\">\n      <div class=\"adiy-anim\">\n        <span class=\"adiy-eyebrow\">What you get</span>\n        <h2 class=\"adiy-h2\">Everything in One Kit. Nothing Left to Figure Out.</h2>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"adiy-benefits__grid adiy-anim\">\n        <div class=\"adiy-benefit\">\n          <div class=\"adiy-benefit__icon\">💰</div>\n          <div class=\"adiy-benefit__title\">Save 30–50% vs. Contractors</div>\n          <div class=\"adiy-benefit__body\">Premium quality. Contractor-level finish. A fraction of the price. Most customers save thousands — sometimes $10,000 or more.</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"adiy-benefit\">\n          <div class=\"adiy-benefit__icon\">⚡</div>\n          <div class=\"adiy-benefit__title\">Build in Hours, Not Weeks</div>\n          <div class=\"adiy-benefit__body\">No multi-week project. No lost weekends. Assembly takes hours from start to finish — most homeowners are done in a single day.</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"adiy-benefit\">\n          <div class=\"adiy-benefit__icon\">🔧</div>\n          <div class=\"adiy-benefit__title\">One Tool: Your Power Drill</div>\n          <div class=\"adiy-benefit__body\">No circular saw. No miter saw. No measuring tape. Just a standard residential power drill — the kind most people already own.</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"adiy-benefit\">\n          <div class=\"adiy-benefit__icon\">📐</div>\n          <div class=\"adiy-benefit__title\">Pre-Cut, Pre-Measured, Pre-Labeled</div>\n          <div class=\"adiy-benefit__body\">Every component is engineered and prepared in advance. Your only job is to follow the steps — not figure them out.</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"adiy-benefit\">\n          <div class=\"adiy-benefit__icon\">🏗️</div>\n          <div class=\"adiy-benefit__title\">Professional-Grade Engineering</div>\n          <div class=\"adiy-benefit__body\">Built to residential code standards. Strong, durable, and designed to last for decades. This isn't a shortcut — it's a smarter system.</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"adiy-benefit\">\n          <div class=\"adiy-benefit__icon\">🎨</div>\n          <div class=\"adiy-benefit__title\">Fully Customizable</div>\n          <div class=\"adiy-benefit__body\">Choose your deck size, elevation method, railings, and stairs. Your deck, your vision — our system makes any configuration possible.</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"adiy-benefit\">\n          <div class=\"adiy-benefit__icon\">📦</div>\n          <div class=\"adiy-benefit__title\">Absolutely Everything Included</div>\n          <div class=\"adiy-benefit__body\">Lumber, screws, hardware, drill bit, and 3D visual instructions. Nothing to source separately. Nothing forgotten. One box, one deck.</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"adiy-benefit\">\n          <div class=\"adiy-benefit__icon\">🤝</div>\n          <div class=\"adiy-benefit__title\">Expert Support at Every Stage</div>\n          <div class=\"adiy-benefit__body\">Our team is available from design to assembly. You're never on your own — and most questions get answered the same day.</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════\n       SECTION 6 — SOCIAL PROOF\n  ══════════════════════════════════ -->\n  <section class=\"adiy-section\" style=\"background:#fff;\">\n    <div class=\"adiy-container\">\n      <div class=\"adiy-anim\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n        <span class=\"adiy-eyebrow\">Real reviews from real homeowners</span>\n        <h2 class=\"adiy-h2\">\"I'm Not Handy — But I Built My Deck in a Day\"</h2>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"adiy-reviews__grid adiy-anim\">\n        <div class=\"adiy-review\">\n          <div class=\"adiy-review__stars\">★★★★★</div>\n          <div class=\"adiy-review__tag\">Saved Thousands</div>\n          <p class=\"adiy-review__text\">\"I called three contractors. The lowest quote was $16,500. My A-DIY deck cost a fraction of that, and I put it together myself over a Saturday. It looks like a professional built it — because the system practically builds itself.\"</p>\n          <div class=\"adiy-review__author\">Lori M.</div>\n          <div class=\"adiy-review__location\">Verified Buyer</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"adiy-review\">\n          <div class=\"adiy-review__stars\">★★★★★</div>\n          <div class=\"adiy-review__tag\">Built in a Day</div>\n          <p class=\"adiy-review__text\">\"I'm not the handiest person — I'll say it plainly. But the instructions were so clear and every piece was so carefully labeled that I had the whole deck assembled in under two hours. My neighbours still don't believe I did it myself.\"</p>\n          <div class=\"adiy-review__author\">Steve J.</div>\n          <div class=\"adiy-review__location\">Verified Buyer</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"adiy-review\">\n          <div class=\"adiy-review__stars\">★★★★★</div>\n          <div class=\"adiy-review__tag\">Pro-Grade Quality</div>\n          <p class=\"adiy-review__text\">\"I've been in construction for 20 years, and I'm genuinely impressed by the engineering. The modular design is smart. The tolerances are tight. My colleagues keep asking who built it — and I enjoy telling them I did.\"</p>\n          <div class=\"adiy-review__author\">Matthew R.</div>\n          <div class=\"adiy-review__location\">Verified Buyer</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <!-- Trust badges -->\n      <div class=\"adiy-trust-badges adiy-anim\">\n        <div class=\"adiy-trust-badge\"><span>✅</span> 5,000+ Decks Built</div>\n        <div class=\"adiy-trust-badge\"><span>⭐</span> Rated 4.9 / 5 Stars</div>\n        <div class=\"adiy-trust-badge\"><span>🚚</span> Ships to Your Door</div>\n        <div class=\"adiy-trust-badge\"><span>🔒</span> Beginner-Friendly Guarantee</div>\n        <div class=\"adiy-trust-badge\"><span>💳</span> Pay Over 24 Months with Affirm</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════\n       SECTION 7 — DECISION SPLIT\n  ══════════════════════════════════ -->\n  <section class=\"adiy-split\">\n    <div class=\"adiy-container\">\n      <div class=\"adiy-split__header adiy-anim\">\n        <span class=\"adiy-eyebrow\" style=\"color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);\">Choose your path</span>\n        <h2 class=\"adiy-h2\">Which of These Sounds Like You?</h2>\n        <p>Tell us where you are — we'll point you in the right direction.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"adiy-split__grid adiy-anim\">\n        <div class=\"adiy-split__card adiy-split__card--consult\">\n          <div class=\"adiy-split__card__eyebrow\">Option A</div>\n          <div class=\"adiy-split__card__title\">\"I know I want a deck, but I'm not sure where to start.\"</div>\n          <div class=\"adiy-split__card__body\">Questions about size? Foundation options? Building on a slope? Budget guidance? That's exactly what our free design consultation is for. A deck specialist walks you through everything — no sales pressure, just answers.</div>\n          <a href=\"https://a-diy.com/pages/design-consultation-1\" class=\"adiy-btn--split-p\">\n            👋 Book My Free Consultation →\n          </a>\n          <div class=\"adiy-split__card__microcopy\">Free · 15 minutes · No commitment required</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"adiy-split__card adiy-split__card--shop\">\n          <div class=\"adiy-split__card__eyebrow\">Option B</div>\n          <div class=\"adiy-split__card__title\">\"I know what I want. I'm ready to build.\"</div>\n          <div class=\"adiy-split__card__body\">You've done your research. You know the size. Browse the full kit lineup — pressure-treated, composite, ground-level, elevated — and configure your perfect deck. Everything ships to your door.</div>\n          <a href=\"https://a-diy.com/products/pressure-treated-kiln-dried-wood-deck-kit\" class=\"adiy-btn--split-s\">\n            🛒 Shop Deck Kits →\n          </a>\n          <div class=\"adiy-split__card__microcopy\">Ships fast · Everything included · Pay over 24 months</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════\n       SECTION 8 — FAQ\n  ══════════════════════════════════ -->\n  <section class=\"adiy-section adiy-section--off\">\n    <div class=\"adiy-container--narrow\">\n      <div class=\"adiy-anim\">\n        <span class=\"adiy-eyebrow\">Questions & answers</span>\n        <h2 class=\"adiy-h2\">Everything Homeowners Ask Before They Order</h2>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"adiy-faq__list adiy-anim\">\n        <div class=\"adiy-faq__item\">\n          <div class=\"adiy-faq__q\">Do I need any special tools or equipment?</div>\n          <div class=\"adiy-faq__a\">Just a standard residential power drill — the kind most homeowners already own. We include the drill bit, screws, and every piece of hardware. No circular saws, no miter saws, no tape measures required.</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"adiy-faq__item\">\n          <div class=\"adiy-faq__q\">How long does it actually take to build?</div>\n          <div class=\"adiy-faq__a\">Most customers complete their deck in a single day. Some simpler configurations take just a few hours. Assembly time depends on kit size, but there's no multi-day or multi-weekend project here.</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"adiy-faq__item\">\n          <div class=\"adiy-faq__q\">I've never built anything before. Can I really do this?</div>\n          <div class=\"adiy-faq__a\">Yes — and we hear this constantly from customers who were convinced they couldn't. The system was specifically designed for first-time builders. The 3D visual instructions walk you through every connection, step by step. If you can follow directions, you can build this deck.</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"adiy-faq__item\">\n          <div class=\"adiy-faq__q\">What exactly comes in the kit?</div>\n          <div class=\"adiy-faq__a\">Everything. Pre-cut and labeled lumber, all screws and hardware, a drill bit, and a full set of 3D assembly instructions. You won't need to make a single lumber yard or hardware store run. If anything is missing, we make it right.</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"adiy-faq__item\">\n          <div class=\"adiy-faq__q\">Can I customize the size, height, or features?</div>\n          <div class=\"adiy-faq__a\">Yes. Kits are available in multiple sizes and configurations. You can choose your foundation type (deck blocks for ground-level, sono tubes or helical piles for elevated builds), and add railings, stairs, and finishing options. Book a free consultation and we'll spec out exactly what you need.</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"adiy-faq__item\">\n          <div class=\"adiy-faq__q\">Is the quality as good as a contractor-built deck?</div>\n          <div class=\"adiy-faq__a\">The materials and engineering are professional-grade. The lumber is pressure-treated and kiln-dried. The structural system is engineered to residential standards. The difference is you're paying for materials — not contractor markup and labor.</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"adiy-faq__item\">\n          <div class=\"adiy-faq__q\">What if I get stuck during the build?</div>\n          <div class=\"adiy-faq__a\">Our expert team is available by phone and email throughout your build. You're never on your own. We've helped thousands of customers through assembly, and most questions get answered the same day you ask.</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"adiy-faq__item\">\n          <div class=\"adiy-faq__q\">How does the free design consultation work?</div>\n          <div class=\"adiy-faq__a\">It's a short 15-minute call with one of our deck specialists. You tell us about your space, goals, and budget. We recommend the right kit and configuration. Zero pressure, zero obligation — just honest guidance so you can make the right decision.</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════\n       SECTION 9 — FINAL CTA\n  ══════════════════════════════════ -->\n  <section class=\"adiy-close\">\n    <div class=\"adiy-container adiy-close__inner\">\n      <span class=\"adiy-eyebrow\" style=\"color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);\">Your backyard is waiting</span>\n      <h2 class=\"adiy-h2 adiy-anim\">A Year From Now, You'll Wish You'd Started Today.</h2>\n      <p class=\"adiy-close__body adiy-anim\">Right now, your backyard is just a yard. This time next summer, it could be where you host every family dinner, where the kids spend their weekends, where mornings begin and evenings end. You don't need a contractor. You don't need experience. You just need the right system — and a free afternoon.</p>\n      <div class=\"adiy-close__ctas adiy-anim\">\n        <a href=\"https://a-diy.com/pages/design-consultation-1\" class=\"adiy-btn adiy-btn--primary adiy-btn--lg\">\n          👋 Book My Free Consultation — 15 Min, Free\n        </a>\n        <a href=\"https://a-diy.com/products/pressure-treated-kiln-dried-wood-deck-kit\" class=\"adiy-btn adiy-btn--secondary adiy-btn--lg\">\n          🛒 Shop Deck Kits\n        </a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"adiy-close__trust\">\n        <span class=\"adiy-close__stars\">★★★★★</span> 5,000+ happy homeowners &nbsp;·&nbsp; Ships to your door &nbsp;·&nbsp; Expert support included &nbsp;·&nbsp; Pay over 24 months with Affirm\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n</div><!-- /adiy-page -->\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  // ── Scroll reveal ──\n  var elems = document.querySelectorAll('.adiy-anim');\n  if('IntersectionObserver' in window){\n    var obs = new IntersectionObserver(function(entries){\n      entries.forEach(function(e){\n        if(e.isIntersecting){ e.target.classList.add('visible'); obs.unobserve(e.target); }\n      });\n    },{threshold:0.12});\n    elems.forEach(function(el){ obs.observe(el); });\n  } else {\n    elems.forEach(function(el){ el.classList.add('visible'); });\n  }\n\n  // ── FAQ accordion ──\n  document.querySelectorAll('.adiy-faq__q').forEach(function(q){\n    q.addEventListener('click', function(){\n      var item = q.closest('.adiy-faq__item');\n      var wasOpen = item.classList.contains('open');\n      document.querySelectorAll('.adiy-faq__item.open').forEach(function(o){ o.classList.remove('open'); });\n      if(!wasOpen) item.classList.add('open');\n    });\n  });\n})();\n</script>",
